name basque-date
category Package
revision 26477
shortdesc Print the date in Basque.
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides two LaTeX commands to print the current
longdesc date in Basque according to the correct forms ruled by The
longdesc Basque Language Academy (Euskaltzaindia). The commands
longdesc automatically solve the complex declination issues of numbers
longdesc in Basque.
