name beamerdarkthemes
category Package
revision 35101
shortdesc Dark color themes for beamer.
relocated 1
longdesc A package with three dark color themes for beamer, designed for
longdesc presentations with pictures and/or for bright rooms without
longdesc screen. These themes mix one dominant foreground colour and a
longdesc black background. Cormorant stands for green, frigatebird for
longdesc red and magpie for blue.
