name bnumexpr
category Package
revision 35511
shortdesc Extends eTeX's \numexpr...\relax construct to big integers.
relocated 1
longdesc The package extends eTeX \numexpr...\relax operation to allow
longdesc big integers. Package option allowpower furthermore enables ^
longdesc for power operations. By default, bnumexpr loads package
longdesc xintcore (part of the xint bundle) and uses its arithmetic
longdesc macros.
