name cantarell
category Package
revision 27066
shortdesc LaTeX support for the Cantarell font family.
relocated 1
longdesc Cantarell is a contemporary Humanist sans serif designed by
longdesc Dave Crossland and Jakub Steiner. This font, delivered under
longdesc the OFL version 1.1, is available on the GNOME download server.
longdesc The present package provides support for this font in LaTeX. It
longdesc includes Type 1 versions of the fonts, converted for this
longdesc package using FontForge from its sources, for full support with
longdesc Dvips.
execute addMap cantarell.map
