name carlito
category Package
revision 35002
shortdesc Support for Carlito sans-serif fonts
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
longdesc support for the Carlito family of sans serif fonts, designed by
longdesc Lukasz Dziedzic of the tyPoland foundry and adopted by Google
longdesc for ChromeOS as a font-metric compatible replacement for
longdesc Calibri.
execute addMap carlito.map
