name cjhebrew
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Typeset Hebrew with LaTeX.
relocated 1
longdesc The cjhebrew package provides Adobe Type 1 fonts for Hebrew,
longdesc and LaTeX macros to support their use. Hebrew text can be
longdesc vocalised, and a few accents are also available. The package
longdesc makes it easy to include Hebrew text in other-language
longdesc documents. The package makes use of the e-TeX extensions to
longdesc TeX, so should be run using an "e-LaTeX".
execute addMap cjhebrew.map
