name classicthesis
category Package
revision 38304
shortdesc A "classically styled" thesis package
relocated 1
longdesc The classicthesis package provides an elegant layout designed
longdesc in homage to Bringhurst's "The Elements of Typographic Style".
longdesc It makes use of a range of techniques to get the best results
longdesc achievable using TeX. Included in the bundle are templates to
longdesc make thesis writing easier.
