name clrscode3e
category Package
revision 34887
shortdesc Typesets pseudocode as in Introduction to Algorithms.
relocated 1
longdesc This package allows you to typeset pseudocode in the style of
longdesc Introduction to Algorithms, Third edition, by Cormen,
longdesc Leiserson, Rivest, and Stein. The package was written by the
longdesc authors. Use the commands the same way the package's author did
longdesc when writing the book, and your output will look just like the
longdesc pseudocode in the text.
