name codicefiscaleitaliano
category Package
revision 29803
shortdesc Test the consistency of the Italian personal Fiscal Code.
relocated 1
longdesc The alphanumeric string that forms the Italian personal Fiscal
longdesc Code is prone to be misspelled thus rendering a legal document
longdesc invalid. The package quickly verifies the consistency of the
longdesc fiscal code string, and can therefore be useful for lawyers and
longdesc accountants that use fiscal codes very frequently.
