longdesc serves as a LaTeX 2e replacement for picture mode. In
longdesc particular, curve2e introduces new macros for lines and
longdesc vectors, new specifications for line terminations and joins,
longdesc arcs with any angular aperture, arcs with arrows at one or both
longdesc ends, generic curves specified with their nodes and the tangent
longdesc direction at these nodes.
