name ebgaramond-maths
category Package
revision 35701
shortdesc LaTeX support for EBGaramond fonts in mathematics
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides some LaTeX support for the use of
longdesc EBGaramond12 in mathematics. It is based on, and requires,
longdesc ebgaramond. The package was created in response to a question
longdesc at TeX-stackexchange. and tested in the form of an answer in
longdesc the same forum.
