name fixltxhyph
category Package
revision 25832
shortdesc Allow hyphenation of partially-emphasised substrings.
relocated 1
longdesc The package fixes the problem of TeX failing to hyphenate
longdesc letter strings that seem (to TeX) to be words, but which are
longdesc followed by an apostrophe and then an emphasis command. The
longdesc cause of the problem is not the apostrophe, but the font change
longdesc in the middle of the string. The problem arises in Catalan,
longdesc French, Italian and Romansh.
