name gfssolomos
category Package
revision 18651
shortdesc A Greek-alphabet font.
relocated 1
longdesc Solomos is a font which traces its descent from a
longdesc calligraphically-inspired font of the mid-19th century. LaTeX
longdesc support, for use with the LGR encoding only, is provided.
