name ghab
category Package
revision 29803
shortdesc Typeset ghab boxes in LaTeX.
relocated 1
longdesc The package defines a command \darghab that will typeset its
longdesc argument in a box with a decorated frame. The width of the box
longdesc may be set using an optional argument.
