name ibygrk
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Fonts and macros to typeset ancient Greek.
relocated 1
longdesc Ibycus is a Greek typeface, based on Silvio Levy's realisation
longdesc of a classic Didot cut of Greek type from around 1800. The
longdesc fonts are available both as Metafont source and in Adobe Type 1
longdesc format. This distribution of ibycus is accompanied by a set of
longdesc macro packages to use it with Plain TeX or LaTeX, but for use
longdesc with Babel, see the ibycus-babel package.
execute addMixedMap iby.map
