name iitem
category Package
revision 29613
shortdesc Multiple level of lists in one list-like environment.
relocated 1
longdesc The package defines multiple level lists within one list-like
longdesc environment. instead of writing \begin{enumerate} \item 1
longdesc \begin{enumerate} \item 2 \begin{enumerate} \item 3
longdesc \begin{enumerate} \item 4 \end{enumerate} \end{enumerate} \item
longdesc 2.1 \end{enumerate} \item 1.1 \begin{enumerate} \item 2
longdesc \end{enumerate} \end{enumerate} this package allows you to
longdesc write \begin{enumerate} \item 1 \iitem 2 \iiitem 3 \ivtem 4
longdesc \iitem 2.1 \item 1.1 \iitem 2 \end{enumerate}
