longdesc indexes simultaneously with a document. The package is known to
longdesc work in LaTeX documents processed with pdflatex, xelatatex and
longdesc lualatex. If makeindex is used for processing the index
longdesc entries, no particular setting up is needed when TeX Live is
longdesc used. Using xindy or other programs it is necessary to enable
longdesc shell escape; shell escape is also needed if splitindex is
longdesc used.
