name indextools
category Package
revision 36138
shortdesc A fork of imakeidx to fixe one bug with bidi
relocated 1
longdesc This package is a fork of the imakeidx package. The original
longdesc authors of imakeidx declined some upgrade suggestions to remove
longdesc incompatibilities with certain packages that are particularly
longdesc important with critical editions dealing with languages that
longdesc are being written from right to left. Therefore this fork was
longdesc created in order to let other users benefit from its
longdesc functionalities very useful in the field of humanities.
