name latex-tds
category Package
revision 35577
shortdesc A structured copy of the LaTeX distribution.
relocated 1
longdesc This bundle provides a set of zip file modules containing TDS-
longdesc compliant trees for items of the LaTeX distribution (both the
longdesc base system and required packages), together with 'user-
longdesc friendly' documentation (PDF files with navigation support
longdesc using bookmarks and links). A further module (knuth) performs
longdesc the same service for Knuth's software distribution.
