name math-e
category Package
revision 20062
shortdesc Examples from the book Typesetting Mathematics with LaTeX.
relocated 1
longdesc The bundle contains all the examples from the (English) book
longdesc "Typesetting Mathematics with LaTeX" (UIT Press, Cambridge,
longdesc 2010). The examples are stand alone documents and may be
longdesc separately processed with LaTeX or PDFLaTeX.
