name mdputu
category Package
revision 20298
shortdesc Upright digits in Adobe Utopia Italic.
relocated 1
longdesc The Annals of Mathematics uses italics for theorems. However,
longdesc slanted digits and parentheses look disturbing when surrounded
longdesc by (upright) mathematics. This package provides virtual fonts
longdesc with italics and upright digits and punctuation, as an
longdesc extension to Mathdesign's Utopia bundle.
