name mf2pt1
category Package
revision 33802
shortdesc Produce PostScript Type 1 fonts from Metafont source.
longdesc mf2pt1 facilitates producing PostScript Type 1 fonts from a
longdesc Metafont source file. It is not, as the name may imply, an
longdesc automatic converter of arbitrary Metafont fonts to Type 1
longdesc format. mf2pt1 imposes a number of restrictions on the Metafont
longdesc input. If these restrictions are met, mf2pt1 will produce valid
longdesc Type 1 output with more accurate control points than can be
longdesc reverse-engineered by TeXtrace, mftrace, and other programs
longdesc which convert bitmaps to outline fonts.
depend mf2pt1.ARCH
