longdesc fonts, designed by Dario Manuel Muhafara of the TIPO foundry
longdesc (http://www.tipo.net.ar) are "rounded" sans-serif fonts in
longdesc three weights (Regular, Bold, Black) with italic variants for
longdesc each of them. There are also small-caps and old-style figures
longdesc in the Regular weight.
