name pdf14
category Package
revision 17583
shortdesc Restore PDF 1.4 to a TeX live 2010 format.
relocated 1
longdesc Starting with TeX Live 2010, the various formats, that directly
longdesc generate PDF, default to generating PDF 1.5. This is generally
longdesc a good thing, but it can lead to compatibility issues with some
longdesc older PDF viewers. This package changes the version of PDF
longdesc generated with formats (based on pdfTeX or LuaTeX in PDF mode),
longdesc back to 1.4 for documents that need to achieve maximal
longdesc compatibility with old viewers.
