name pgfopts
category Package
revision 34573
shortdesc LaTeX package options with pgfkeys.
relocated 1
longdesc The pgfkeys package (part of the pgf distribution) is a well-
longdesc designed way of defining and using large numbers of keys for
longdesc key-value syntaxes. However, pgfkeys itself does not offer
longdesc means of handling LaTeX class and package options. This package
longdesc adds such option handling to pgfkeys, in the same way that
longdesc kvoptions adds the same facility to the LaTeX standard keyval
longdesc package.
