name piano
category Package
revision 21574
shortdesc Typeset a basic 2-octave piano diagram.
relocated 1
longdesc This package adds the \keyboard[1][2]..[7] command to your
longdesc project. When used, it draws a small 2 octaves piano keyboard
longdesc on your document, with up to 7 keys highlighted. Keys go : Co,
longdesc Cso, Do, Dso, Eo, Fo, Fso, Go, Gso, Ao, Aso, Bo, Ct, Cst, Dt,
longdesc Dst, Et, Ft, Fst, Gt, Gst, At, Ast and Bt. (A working example
longdesc is included in the README file.)
