name pmx
category Package
revision 35650
shortdesc Preprocessor for MusiXTeX.
longdesc PMX is a preprocessor for MusiXTeX. It builds the TeX input
longdesc file from a file in a much simpler language, making most of the
longdesc layout decisions by itself. An auxiliary program makes single-
longdesc player parts from a multi-player score. For proof-listening,
longdesc PMX can make a MIDI file of your score. The present version
longdesc requires at least version 1.15 of MusiXTeX, running on an e-tex-
longdesc enhanced TeX system.
depend pmx.ARCH
