name polyglossia
category Package
revision 38072
shortdesc An alternative to babel for XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides a complete Babel replacement for users of
longdesc LuaLaTeX and XeLaTeX; it relies on the fontspec package,
longdesc version 2.0 at least. This is the first release that supports
longdesc use with LuaLaTeX; it should be considered "transitional" in
longdesc that role.
depend etoolbox
depend fontspec
depend ifluatex
depend makecmds
depend xkeyval
