name proposal
category Package
revision 29174
shortdesc A class for preparing proposals.
relocated 1
longdesc The process of preparing a collaborative proposal, to a major
longdesc funding body, involves integration of contributions of a many
longdesc people at many sites. It is therefore an ideal application for
longdesc a text-based document preparation system such as LaTeX, in
longdesc concert with a distributed version control system such as SVN.
longdesc The proposal class itself provides a basis for such an
longdesc enterprise. The dfgproposal and dfgproposal classes provide two
longdesc specialisations of the base class for (respectively) German and
longdesc European research proposals. The packages depend on the
longdesc author's stex bundle.
