name pst-rubans
category Package
revision 23464
shortdesc Draw three-dimensional ribbons.
relocated 1
longdesc The package uses PStricks and pst-solides3d to draw three
longdesc dimensional ribbons on a cylinder, torus, sphere, cone or
longdesc paraboloid. The width of the ribbon, the number of turns, the
longdesc colour of the outer and the inner surface of the ribbon may be
longdesc set. In the case of circular and conical helices, one may also
longdesc choose the number of ribbons.
