name pst-sigsys
category Package
revision 21667
shortdesc Support of signal processing-related disciplines.
relocated 1
longdesc The package offers a collection of useful macros for
longdesc disciplines related to signal processing. It defines macros for
longdesc plotting a sequence of numbers, drawing the pole-zero diagram
longdesc of a system, shading the region of convergence, creating an
longdesc adder or a multiplier node, placing a framed node at a given
longdesc coordinate, creating an up-sampler or a down-sampler node,
longdesc drawing the block diagram of a system, drawing adaptive
longdesc systems, sequentially connecting a list of nodes, and
longdesc connecting a list of nodes using any node-connecting macro.
