name quran
category Package
revision 37882
shortdesc An easy way to typeset any part of The Holy Quran.
relocated 1
longdesc This package offers the user an easy way to typeset The Holy
longdesc Quran. It has been inspired by the lipsum and ptext packages
longdesc and provides several macros for typesetting the whole or any
longdesc part of Quran based on its popular division. Available macros
longdesc are: \quransurah, \quranayah, \quranjuz, \quranhizb,
longdesc \quranquarter, \quranpage, \qurantext, \surahname, \basmalah.
longdesc The package only works with the "xelatex" format and should be
longdesc loaded before the bidi package.
runfiles size=376
