longdesc for typesetting one or two recipes per page, with dimensions of
longdesc 5.5" x 8.5". The hyperlinked table of contents (ToC) and page
longdesc numbers make browsing recipes convenient, and the pages can be
longdesc joined together or printed two per sheet to normal letterpaper
longdesc easily. The size was chosen to work in half-page 3-ring binder
longdesc cover sheets.
