name roboto
category Package
revision 36893
shortdesc Support for the Roboto family of fonts.
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
longdesc support for the Roboto, RobotoCondensed and RobotoSlab families
longdesc of fonts, designed by Christian Robertson for Google.
