longdesc sets of pages are rotated by 180 degrees and rearranged, so
longdesc that they can be read by turning the printed copy upside-down.
longdesc It was developed for collecting exercises and solutions: using
longdesc the package, you can print the exercise text normally and the
longdesc solutions rotated.
