longdesc tree diagrams suitable for Role and Reference Grammar (RRG).
longdesc This package allows the construction of trees with crossing
longdesc lines, as is required by this theory for many languages. There
longdesc is no known limit on number of tree nodes or levels. Requires
longdesc the pst-node and pst-tree LaTeX packages.
