name russ
category Package
revision 25209
shortdesc LaTeX in Russian, without babel.
relocated 1
longdesc The package aims to facilitate Russian typesetting (based on
longdesc input using MicroSoft Code Page 1251). Russian hyphenation is
longdesc selected, and various mathematical commands are set up in
longdesc Russian style. Furthermore all Cyrillic letters' catcodes are
longdesc set to "letter", so that commands with Cyrillic letters in
longdesc their names may be defined.
