name texilikechaps
category Package
revision 28553
shortdesc Format chapters with a texi-like format.
relocated 1
longdesc The package enables the user to reduce the size of the rather
longdesc large chapter headings in standard classes into a texi-like
longdesc smaller format. Details of the format may be controlled with
longdesc internal commands.
