name tfrupee
category Package
revision 20770
shortdesc A font offering the new (Indian) Rupee symbol.
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides LaTeX support for the (Indian) Rupee
longdesc symbol font, created by TechFat. The original font has been
longdesc converted to Adobe Type 1 format, and simple LaTeX support
longdesc written for its use.
execute addMap tfrupee.map
runfiles size=191
