longdesc section, after the caption. This scheme provides an answer to
longdesc the old problem of putting footnotes in tables -- by making
longdesc footnotes entirely unnecessary. Note that a threeparttable is
longdesc not a float of itself; but you can place it in a table or a
longdesc table* environment, if necessary.
