catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-version 3.4

name urwchancal
category Package
revision 21701
shortdesc Use URW's clone of Zapf Chancery as a maths alphabet.
relocated 1
longdesc The package allows (the URW clone of) Zapf Chancery to function
longdesc as a maths alphabet, the target of \mathcal or \mathscr, with
longdesc accents appearing where they should, and other spacing
longdesc parameters set to reasonable (not very tight) values. The font
longdesc itself may be found in the URW basic fonts collection. This
longdesc package supersedes the pzccal package.
