longdesc macros for typesetting documents in Vietnamese. Users of the
longdesc fonts (in both Metafont and Adobe Type 1 format) of this bundle
longdesc may alternatively use the lm fonts bundle, for which map files
longdesc are available to provide a Vietnamese version.
