name zhspacing
category Package
revision 25644
shortdesc Spacing for mixed CJK-English documents in XeTeX.
relocated 1
longdesc The package manages spacing in a CJK document; between
longdesc consecutive Chinese letters, spaces are ignored, but a
longdesc consistent space is inserted between Chinese text and English
longdesc (or mathematics). The package may be used by any document
longdesc format under XeTeX.
